@startuml activity-book-package
!include _style.iuml
title Activity — customer books a maintenance package (UC04, with UC20, UC21, UC22)

|Customer|
|Web app|
|API|
|PostgreSQL|
|Customer|
start
if (Has a vehicle?) then (no)
  :Add a vehicle;
else (yes)
endif
:Choose the vehicle;
:Choose a package
(only packages for this vehicle type);
repeat :Choose a dealership;
  |API|
  :Check the dealership has a bay of the
  package's type and a technician with its skill;
repeat while (Can this dealership do the job?) is (no: "cannot do this job here")
-> yes;
:Compute the day's start times: a free bay
AND a qualified technician on shift for the
whole job, inside opening hours, after lead time;
|Web app|
:Open the first day that still has a free time,
refresh availability every 30 s;
repeat
  |Customer|
  :Pick a start time;
  :Review, add a note, press **Confirm booking**;
  |Web app|
  :Send with an Idempotency-Key
  (new key per distinct attempt);
  |API|
  if (Same key already booked?) then (yes)
    :Return the original appointment
    (200, Idempotent-Replayed);
  else (no)
    if (Start time valid? open day, on the grid,
inside hours, ≥ lead time, ≤ max days ahead) then (no)
      :422 with the reason;
    else (yes)
      repeat
        :Transaction: read free bays and technicians,
        allocate best fit (fewest skills, least loaded);
        if (A free pair?) then (no)
          break
        endif
        |PostgreSQL|
        :INSERT appointment;
        :EXCLUDE constraints reject any overlap
        of bay, technician or vehicle;
        note right
          Vehicle overlap → 409 VEHICLE_ALREADY_BOOKED
          (no retry: the customer must pick another time)
        end note
        |API|
      repeat while (Lost the race on the bay or technician,
and fewer than 5 attempts?) is (yes: retry with fresh data)
      -> no;
      if (Inserted?) then (yes)
        :Commit, record CONFIRMED in the audit trail,
        log booking.created, count the metric;
      else (no)
        :409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE with the 3 nearest
        free times, log booking.slot_unavailable;
        |Web app|
        :Show "taken a moment ago" and
        the alternatives as buttons;
      endif
    endif
  endif
  |Customer|
repeat while (Booked?) is (no: pick another time\nor one of the alternatives)
-> yes;
|Web app|
:Show the reference, technician and ticket;
|Customer|
:Optionally add to calendar (.ics);
stop
@enduml
